Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:44:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): add PLUR1BUS agent preset

Add PLUR1BUS as a tier-2 preset ACP harness using its CLI's native ACP
mode (`plur1bus acp`), with setup guidance linking the PLUR1BUS Harness
repository, a bundled MIT-licensed mark, and a curated catalog
description.

`plur1bus acp` is a thin ACP front end to the local PLUR1BUS core
daemon, so PATH availability does not imply a running daemon (same
tier-2 semantics as OpenClaw); the buzz-acp README notes this and the
execution locus of BUZZ_* credentials.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
